### Prices API - manual requests
### Run the app first: ./mvnw spring-boot:run
### In IntelliJ, click the green arrow next to each request (or "Run All").

@host = http://localhost:8080
@path = /api/v1/prices

### Test 1: day 14 at 10:00 -> price list 1, 35.50 EUR
GET {{host}}{{path}}?applicationDate=2020-06-14T10:00:00&productId=35455&brandId=1

### Test 2: day 14 at 16:00 -> price list 2, 25.45 EUR
GET {{host}}{{path}}?applicationDate=2020-06-14T16:00:00&productId=35455&brandId=1

### Test 3: day 14 at 21:00 -> price list 1, 35.50 EUR
GET {{host}}{{path}}?applicationDate=2020-06-14T21:00:00&productId=35455&brandId=1

### Test 4: day 15 at 10:00 -> price list 3, 30.50 EUR
GET {{host}}{{path}}?applicationDate=2020-06-15T10:00:00&productId=35455&brandId=1

### Test 5: day 16 at 21:00 -> price list 4, 38.95 EUR
GET {{host}}{{path}}?applicationDate=2020-06-16T21:00:00&productId=35455&brandId=1

### 404: no price applies before 2020-06-14
GET {{host}}{{path}}?applicationDate=2019-01-01T00:00:00&productId=35455&brandId=1

### 404: unknown product
GET {{host}}{{path}}?applicationDate=2020-06-14T10:00:00&productId=1&brandId=1

### 400: missing brandId
GET {{host}}{{path}}?applicationDate=2020-06-14T10:00:00&productId=35455

### 400: malformed date
GET {{host}}{{path}}?applicationDate=14/06/2020&productId=35455&brandId=1

### 400: non-positive id
GET {{host}}{{path}}?applicationDate=2020-06-14T10:00:00&productId=-1&brandId=1
